# GitHub branches

Start feature and bugfix work on a new branch from `dev`. Open the pull request into `dev`.

`main` takes a pull request from `dev` only, after one approval. Do not push to `main`, and do not open a feature pull request against `main`.

A merge into `dev` runs checks. It does not deploy. A merge into `main` deploys the site (`.github/workflows/web.yml`). When the API or Fastlane is automated, those jobs run on `main` only.

```bash
git checkout dev && git pull
git checkout -b fix/short-name
# pull request base: dev
# after that merges, pull request base: main, compare: dev
```
